    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d380">

                <pb facs="0540" n="420" xml:id="pg420"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Ambassador Porter.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-06-20"><hi rendition="#italic">June 20,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Obtain permission to land military force under arms from Rear-Admiral Sigsbee’s
                    squadron as escort for body Paul Jones.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
